When checking your email, you notice a message from Narcisa. Clicking on it opens the following\:
Hello, I’d like to discuss your progress so far. Please stop by my office when you get the chance so we can talk.\
- Narcisa
A bit ominous. You gulp, wondering what this meeting might entail. You’ve been doing a good job… right?
A couple hours pass, and you knock on her door.
Narcisa: "Come in!"
join Narcisa left
